    <section class="hero">
      <div class="container hero-grid">
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow">Lift Local — for gym owners</div>
          <h1>Hometown merch <span class="accent">members wear outside the gym.</span></h1>
          <p class="hero-lede">Lift Local is a design series built around place, community, and gym identity—not generic fitness clichés. We released ideas gyms are already running with, and the response has been strong. Pick one of three templates or go custom. Forever Fierce designs free, members preorder, we print and ship. No inventory risk.</p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
