            <a class="btn btn-outline" href="#templates">See 3 Templates</a>
          </div>
          <div class="hero-meta"><span>3 templates or custom</span><span>Free design</span><span>Free sizing samples</span><span>Preorder only</span></div>
        </div>
        <aside class="side-card reveal">
          <h2>Why it hits</h2>
          <p>Members do not need another skull-and-barbell graphic. They need something that says: this is our gym, our town, our people.</p>
          <ul class="side-list">
            <li>Hometown identity over generic hype</li>
            <li>Wearable outside the gym (impression engine)</li>
            <li>Easy story to promote on social</li>
            <li>Template speed—or fully custom</li>
          </ul>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>

