    <section class="ideas" id="templates">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="ideas-head">
          <div class="reveal">
            <div class="eyebrow">3 design templates</div>
            <h2 class="section-title">Start fast—or <span class="accent">build from scratch.</span></h2>
          </div>
          <p class="section-copy reveal">Three template slots for the Lift Local series. Drop real art when ready. Each one is customized to your gym—not a stock file with a logo stamped on. Prefer original work? We go fully custom at no art fee.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ideas-grid">
          <article class="idea reveal"><div class="idea-art"><span>Template 01<br>Lift Local</span></div><div class="idea-body"><h3>Template 01</h3><p>Core hometown lockup—city/town + gym mark treatment members wear every day.</p><span class="idea-tag">Template</span></div></article>
          <article class="idea reveal"><div class="idea-art"><span>Template 02<br>Lift Local</span></div><div class="idea-body"><h3>Template 02</h3><p>Community / neighborhood direction—local language with clean type hierarchy.</p><span class="idea-tag">Template</span></div></article>
          <article class="idea reveal"><div class="idea-art"><span>Template 03<br>Lift Local</span></div><div class="idea-body"><h3>Template 03</h3><p>Established / home-gym mark energy—strong on tees, hoodies, and small goods.</p><span class="idea-tag">Template</span></div></article>
        </div>
        <div class="mech-line reveal">Pick a template or go custom · free design · members preorder · we print &amp; ship</div>
        <div class="note-bar reveal"><strong>Custom is always on the table.</strong> Do not force a template if it does not fit. Forever Fierce will build a one-off Lift Local direction around your brand.</div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="how" id="how">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="eyebrow reveal">How Lift Local works</div>
        <h2 class="section-title reveal">Pick a template. <span class="accent">Or go custom.</span></h2>
        <div class="how-grid">
          <article class="how-step reveal"><div class="how-num">01</div><h3>Choose your path</h3><p>Select one of three Lift Local design templates, or brief a fully custom direction. We adapt every concept to your gym name, city, and marks.</p></article>
          <article class="how-step reveal"><div class="how-num">02</div><h3>We design it free</h3><p>Forever Fierce builds production-ready art. You approve, we revise. Free sizing samples go out so fit is dialed before the store opens.</p></article>
          <article class="how-step reveal"><div class="how-num">03</div><h3>Members preorder · we fulfill</h3><p>Branded store, print what sold, pack, and ship or gym-pickup. You promote the hometown story. We run production.</p></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="garments">
