        <h2 class="section-title reveal">Not a one-off tee. <span class="accent">A brand layer.</span></h2>
        <p class="section-copy reveal">Run Lift Local as a focused drop or fold it into your annual Apparel Plan. Same model either way: free design, free samples, preorder, production handled.</p>
