          <h2 class="section-title">Local is the opposite of <span class="accent">generic merch.</span></h2>
          <p class="section-copy">Lift Local gives owners a drop with a clear story, members something they want to wear in public, and the gym a consistent identity that travels outside the box.</p>
          <div class="stats reveal">
            <div class="stat"><strong>17</strong><span>Years</span></div>
            <div class="stat"><strong>5K+</strong><span>Gyms</span></div>
            <div class="stat"><strong>30K+</strong><span>Orders</span></div>
            <div class="stat"><strong>90%+</strong><span>Repeat</span></div>
            <div class="stat"><strong>1.8M</strong><span>Shirts</span></div>
